      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 3 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Low Pressure Area (LPA)\nIssued at: 8:00 AM, 26 August 2025(Tuesday)\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Quezon.\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: Possible FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, expect light to moderate rains over Metro Manila, Cavite and Bulacan within the next 3 hours.\nLight to moderate rains affecting Batangas, Laguna and Rizal which may persist within 3 hours.\n\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 10:53 AM today.\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZJq1n.",
